1
00:00:00,752 --> 00:00:04,392
(Howard:)I think he's taking this Professor
Proton thing pretty hard.

2
00:00:04,556 --> 00:00:06,796
(Raj:)Should we try to console him?

3
00:00:06,958 --> 00:00:12,138
(Howard:)Or... should we respect his privacy
in this moment of grief?

4
00:00:13,298 --> 00:00:15,108
(Raj:)By staying here
and watching the movie.

5
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:17,477
(Howard:)That's what
good friends would do!

6
00:00:23,942 --> 00:00:25,112
(Howard:)Well, at least
without Sheldon here,

7
00:00:25,277 --> 00:00:27,617
(Howard:)we got to start with Episode IV.

8
00:00:27,779 --> 00:00:28,819
(Raj:)True.

9
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:34,330
-l do feel guilty about him.
-Me, too.

10
00:00:34,486 --> 00:00:36,466
(Raj:)-Maybe we should see how he's doing.
-Yeah.

11
00:00:36,621 --> 00:00:39,971
(Raj:)-But after the cantina scene.
-Obviously.

12
00:00:46,131 --> 00:00:49,911
(Sheldon:)Look at Arthur,
cracking up at a joke I told him.

13
00:00:53,839 --> 00:00:55,679
(Sheldon:)I'll never hear
that laugh again.

14
00:00:55,841 --> 00:01:03,021
(Arthur:)You never heard it that time.

